OL,3,GNEWSA'Crack on' with building M4 relief
OL,4,Aroad, says Welsh Tory leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FWelsh Conservative leader Darren Millar
OL,7,Fhas told the Welsh government to "crack
OL,8,Fon" with building an M4 relief road
OL,9,Faround Newport, and a third crossing
OL,10,Fover the Menai Strait.
OL,12,FHis comments come as the second day of
OL,13,Fthe Conservative party conference gets
OL,14,Funder way in Birmingham on Monday.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday, the Welsh government's
OL,17,Fdeputy transport minister is set to
OL,18,Fgive a statement to the Senedd about
OL,19,Fplans for the M4 and Menai Strait.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
