OL,3,GNEWSA'Crack on' with building M4 relief
OL,4,Aroad, says Welsh Tory leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn June, Mark Hooper told the Welsh
OL,7,FParliament a third crossing over the
OL,8,Fstrait was still being considered, but
OL,9,Fruled out resurrecting a previous
OL,10,Fproposal for an M4 relief road.
